In IoT and Industrial IoT (IIoT) based applications, each node will be equipped with different kinds of sensors. The attacks will be different for every node. Traditional IDS and anomaly detection techniques might not be a viable choice for these applications. The unique feature of FL where the computation of ML algorithm is executed at the individual devices makes it an ideal solution for detecting the intrusions and anomalies in the aforementioned applications. Through FL, ML/Deep Neural Network (DNN) based IDS or anomaly detection algorithms can be executed in the local devices, thereby catering to the needs of providing customized defense mechanisms on those devices. Recent works on application of FL for IDS and anomaly detection are discussed below.
Designing IDS for dealing with the cyber-attacks on heterogeneous, complex, and large-scale cyber-physical systems

